        {
          "name": "jinja2cpp:used-for",
          "value": "nonstd::expected behind jinja2::Result<T> in every Load/Render signature (include/jinja2cpp/template.h, template_env.h); make_unexpected in parsers and bindings"
        },
        {
          "name": "jinja2cpp:why",
          "value": "C++17 has no std::expected; the 2.0 API returns Result<T> (docs/api-2.0.md decision 4), and Clang 18 + libstdc++ at C++23 ships <expected> without std::expected"
        },
        {
          "name": "jinja2cpp:lighten",
          "value": "Keep until a C++23 floor. Header-only and small; could be vendored into include/ so consumers need nothing extra, at the cost of an ODR clash with a consumer's own expected-lite of another version"
        },
