        },
        {
          "name": "jinja2cpp:lighten",
          "value": "Keep. Could be built header-only (FMT_HEADER_ONLY) to remove the link-time dependency of static consumers, at a compile-time cost; replace with std::format only at a C++20 floor (wide output and runtime specs still need checking)"
        },
